  <datafield tag="505" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">What is a letter? -- What is writing? -- What is a word's body? -- What is a document? -- What is graphic textuality? -- What is graphic about graphic novels? -- What is a book? -- What is the cult future of the book? -- What is digital materiality?</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Johanna Drucker is the inaugural Breslauer Professor of Bibliographical Studies in the Department of Information Studies at UCLA. She is internationally known for her work in the history of graphic design, typography, experimental poetry, fine art, and digital humanities. In addition, she has a reputation as a book artist, and her limited edition works are in special collections and libraries worldwide"--Statement from Cuneiform Press (viewed on Vamp &amp; Tramp website August 21, 2014).</subfield>
  </datafield>
